      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I already answered you last time, you just chose to ignore me.\nI use IKFollower is because an issue i reported in https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/avatars-child-objects-bounding-box-does-not-move-with-height-changes\nThe bounding box of the particle system is not correct when changing your avatar's state.\nOther than this problem, i have no reason to use an IKFollower.",
      "viewerReactions": null
